# Compiler output regenerated on demand from the `third_party/libsignal/` crates
# (see `target rustExports` and `ensureRustExports` in `lakefile.lean`).
/.GeneratedLean/

# Mutant trace checkpoints regenerated on demand by `scripts/bug_injection.py gen-ckpt`
