/Symbolic/BugInjection/Disproofs/Impl/SmallSubgroup/Call[0-9]/
/Symbolic/BugInjection/Disproofs/Impl/SmallSubgroup/Call[0-9][0-9]/
/Symbolic/BugInjection/Disproofs/Impl/WeakState/Call[0-9]/
/Symbolic/BugInjection/Disproofs/Impl/WeakState/Call[0-9][0-9]/

# Rust / Cargo
target/
debug/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb
**/mutants.out*/

